# Valley Floodcaller: "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, Birds, Frogs, Otters, and Rats you control get +1/+1 until
# end of turn. Untap them." On turn 5 Bot1 attacks with Floodcaller (an Otter), Psychic Frog and Ornithopter (a Thopter),
# then in the second main phase taps Birds of Paradise for the blue that casts Ancestral Recall. The trigger resolves
# first (CR 603.3): the Otter, the Frog and the Bird get +1/+1 and untap - the Bird that paid for the spell among them -
# while Ornithopter, of none of those types, stays tapped and 0/2, and Bot2's own Birds of Paradise is not pumped ("you
# control"). On turn 3 the creature spell Ornithopter triggers nothing: only its own spell is on the stack.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Valley Floodcaller
Mox Emerald
Birds of Paradise
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Psychic Frog
Ornithopter
Ancestral Recall
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Birds of Paradise
